# Density Compare
# Oganesson (Og) — real density 5 g/cm³. equal masses: Oganesson vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Oganesson Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 11.7mm color: #ffd040 at (-20mm, 5.8mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 39.9 g — the water cube is the reference
